00:47:41.333 --> 00:47:42.766
Belum. Pakai satu tangan.

00:47:43.600 --> 00:47:44.600
Tangan kanan.

00:47:45.666 --> 00:47:45.966
Iya.

00:47:46.533 --> 00:47:48.900
Siko-siko-siko-siko.

00:47:53.100 --> 00:47:54.800
Sampe nggak bisa ngomong apa-apa.

00:47:57.466 --> 00:47:58.933
