00:48:57.900 --> 00:48:59.133
Lepas sendiri bajumu.

00:49:05.133 --> 00:49:06.133
Cepat.

00:49:07.466 --> 00:49:08.466
Cepat lepas.

00:49:17.266 --> 00:49:19.066
Berani-beraninya kamu lepas di sini.

00:49:19.600 --> 00:49:21.733
Habisnya, Sensei yang memancingku.

00:49:23.666 --> 00:49:25.900
