Ya mau lah, jelas.

00:56:20.600 --> 00:56:21.600
Kena deh.

00:56:25.233 --> 00:56:26.233
Gila.

00:56:30.433 --> 00:56:31.866
Padahal pengen banget.

00:56:35.400 --> 00:56:41.033
Ya udah, kalau kamu makin giat belajarnya, nanti aku kasih seks.

00:56:54.633 --> 00:56:56.700
