00:58:05.433 --> 00:58:08.133
Iya, mesum banget.

00:58:09.366 --> 00:58:10.600
Lihat lebih dekat lagi.

00:58:19.900 --> 00:58:20.500
Cocok?

00:58:20.566 --> 00:58:21.566
Ih.

00:58:25.966 --> 00:58:26.966
