01:16:15.500 --> 01:16:16.500
Mm.

01:16:42.000 --> 01:16:43.966
Matamu jadi sayu. Mm.

01:16:49.066 --> 01:16:51.400
Enak sekali.

01:16:57.533 --> 01:16:59.333
Tubuhmu panas sekali, ya.

01:16:59.533 --> 01:17:00.533
Mm.

01:17:01.733 --> 01:17:02.900
